1000 1000 0
E
book~
You open the dusty book and finds that most of the pages have been burned
or crumbled in the past of many years.  The last page in the book seems
rather new, 2 years old tops:
 
* The forces of the black minotaur have invaded our peaceful forest, and we
  are doomed to the retreat in the tombs.  
* In the day of the moon, Year 50 our good king, Tarin, lost his battle against
  the minotaur, and became one of its minions.
* The queen declares the third day in the month of the Moon as a day of
  holiness, no work must be done.
* The minotaur's forces has found our retreat in this mountain, and are now
  invading us, the head of their invading force is Tarin our old king! *sob*
  How cruel can this life be?.
* We are drawn back to our last bastion in the marble hall, and will be able
  to keep this for several days we think. Our queen is often lending a helping
  hand against the enemy.
* The power is rising says the queen, new hope is born.

-referatum.
~
B
